### ==========================================
### Riycol Agent API 测试集合
### 使用 REST Client 扩展直接发送请求
### ==========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000


### 1. 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/health


### 2. 非流式聊天
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "你好，请介绍一下你自己",
  "session_id": "test-001"
}


### 3. SSE 流式聊天
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "用python写一个快速排序",
  "session_id": "test-001"
}


### 4. 知识库状态
GET {{baseUrl}}/kb/status


### 5. 添加文本到知识库
POST {{baseUrl}}/kb/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Riycol Agent 是一个多功能的AI服务平台",
  "source": "manual"
}


### 6. 搜索知识库
POST {{baseUrl}}/kb/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Riycol Agent"
}


### 7. 清除会话
POST {{baseUrl}}/clear
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "test-001"
}


### 8. 指标监控 (需鉴权)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


### 9. 数据库统计 (需鉴权)
GET {{baseUrl}}/db/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


### 10. Prompt 模板列表 (需鉴权)
GET {{baseUrl}}/prompts
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
